WEBVTT

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.670
I could boast about how I got injured…

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.500
but I'm in no mood for that.

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:55.010
It's getting much better now,
but my right hand.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:59.010
The middle phalanx of my little finger
was just cracked, but…

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.100
the ring finger and middle finger,

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:05.560
the third and fourth metacarpals
and the proximal phalanx were pulverized

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.230
and will take four weeks to heal.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:11.780
I really regret what I've done this time

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.690
because I can only blame myself.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.570
I crossed a red line
and stuck my nose into something

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.830
that was none of my business.

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:26.960
I fancied myself as being able
to understand a person's character.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.880
I was such a fool.

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:45.520
Thank God
it's only my hand that's injured.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:50.020
Perhaps it was just sheer luck.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:44.330
EPISODE 9: THE RUN

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:54.590
<i>From S City Station</i>
<i>in southwest Morioh town,</i>

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:57.090
<i>you can reach</i>
<i>Tokyo Station by bullet train</i>

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.010
<i>in an hour and a half.</i>

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:03.300
<i>Another 30-minute train ride</i>
<i>and you reach</i> <i>Harajuku.</i>

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:09.140
Ooh, you've got such a cute face!

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:13.270
Perhaps you're about 178cm tall?

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.780
<i>Hashimoto Yoma happened</i>
<i>to be hanging around in Harajuku</i>

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:21.150
<i>when a scout</i>
<i>from a modeling agency spotted him.</i>

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:24.320
<i>Subsequently,</i>
<i>his photos appeared in a magazine</i>

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:27.080
<i>and then he played a minor role in a film.</i>

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:31.710
<i>While he was on set, he caught</i>
<i>a distant glimpse of the lead actor.</i>

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:36.130
<i>In the beginning, the agent told him…</i>

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:39.170
Movie stars and professional models
must radiate an aura

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.720
even when they are just standing still!

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:44.640
You must train your body!

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:48.350
Beautiful standing poses
matter more than talent!

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:50.810
<i>With such a bright and refreshed feeling,</i>

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:55.270
<i>Hashimoto Yoma was beginning</i>
<i>the best days of his life.</i>

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:16.290
Okay, this is the last push! Three!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.090
Two!

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:21.210
Two!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:22.630
Two!

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:24.840
Still Two!

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:27.390
One!

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:29.810
Last one!

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.690
That's it. Finished!

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:42.150
Perfect!

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:46.660
You know, an instructor lies
through his teeth when he's coaching…

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:50.370
but you stuck it out for a whole week.
That's great!

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:53.710
Just look at how this blood vessel
protrudes.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.870
It's just gorgeous!

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.500
Hmm?

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:36.500
Supper's ready!

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:37.750
Yoma…

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.300
Gee… that hurts!

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.760
Don't leave your weights around here!

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:49.550
And who on earth jumps rope indoors?

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:51.430
Sorry.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.140
I'll put them away.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:56.770
But, hey, you look fantastic.

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:59.230
Look at that six-pack!

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:03.270
You look just like
that Brad Pitt in <i>Fight Club!</i>

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:04.780
Do I?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:10.160
Your body's changed quicker
than I thought. You look so good.

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:13.240
If you could star
in some action-hero movie,

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:15.620
you'd be terrific.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.290
Oh, by the way,
the cod roe spaghetti's ready.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.290
Let's eat while it's hot.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:23.290
Spaghetti?

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:24.250
Yeah.

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:26.630
I told you before, Mika.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:29.880
I don't eat carbs or fat.

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:34.350
I only eat protein.
It's better for muscle development.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.270
STEAMED CHICKEN, EGG WHITE…

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:38.060
Stick to this menu, please.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:41.150
You're only gonna eat this every day?

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.270
Aren't we going out
for karaoke with our friends tonight?

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:45.610
I'm not going.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.650
I'm running a 10K tomorrow at 4:00 a.m.

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:49.490
I've gotta go to bed now.

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:51.860
But it's only seven in the evening!

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:53.990
Oh?

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.950
But there's no money in my wallet.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:58.200
Oh, I forgot to tell you.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.790
There was some protein powder
on sale at the gym.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:05.500
It was 4,800 yen for 2,000g!
Chocolate flavor too!

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:06.960
Good deal, huh?

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:11.220
Definitely cheaper than the cod roe,
so I borrowed 5,000 yen.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.430
Sorry. I'll give you the money back
tomorrow, for sure.

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:15.510
Seriously?

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.470
I've gotta shower and then hit the hay.

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:20.310
You'd better go home now.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:22.480
But this is my apartment!

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.650
Oh. yeah, so, it is.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:31.820
Hey!

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:34.240
You rang that damn intercom three times!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:36.120
I told you before!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.240
-Don't come in the evening!
-Yoma!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.370
-I'm trying to sleep here.
-Stop it, Yoma!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.290
If you wake me up with that bell,
I'll smash your face in!

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:48.340
Sorry about that.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.890
<i>It all started with small talk.</i>

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:02.890
<i>Like, "you start to burn off fat</i>
<i>15 minutes after you start running,</i>

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:07.270
<i>so you should run on the treadmill</i>
<i>for more than 20 minutes as a warm-up."</i>

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:10.110
<i>That's how we started talking.</i>

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.200
Mr. Kishibe, wow,
you're fabulous as usual.

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:16.740
That weight, it's dead easy for you.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.540
Wow, you're in good shape.

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:40.930
Oh, my God!

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.540
Good show. But then…

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.380
we were just having a bit of fun.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:22.350
Hey, should I breathe in or out here?

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:27.190
I'm sorry, I have a client
for personal training now.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.600
Okay. Let's start, then.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:36.240
Your muscles will love it
if you talk to them!

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.320
PERSONAL TRAINING
FROM 270,000 YEN FOR 30 DAYS

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.580
The final push! One!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.330
Two! Three!

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:08.730
Look, I've asked you
not to jump rope in here.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.560
-Have you?
-Yes, I have!

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:14.230
And I told you not to leave
your training stuff all over the place!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.740
Did you? But I need them
for my daily routine.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:20.570
Look how dirty the floor is!

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:23.030
Stop it! Ouch!

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.910
Careful! Don't come too close.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.380
Last! Five! Six! Seven!

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:41.090
Eight! Nine! Ten!

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:56.190
What on earth are you doing?

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:59.030
It's called bouldering, Mika.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.620
Bouldering.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.660
The air conditioner control,

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.040
it's stuck up with glue.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.330
Eh? Is it?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.870
Then you don't need it anymore.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:14.290
This was in my way anyway.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:18.130
When it's gone,
maybe I'll set up a pull-up machine there.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.470
I want to talk about my bank card.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:24.970
You took it from my purse! Give it back!

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.470
Isn't it in your bag?

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.140
No, I mean the money on the card!

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:31.600
You took 270,000 yen without telling me!

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.400
What did you use it for?

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:36.150
I'll return it
when I get the next film job.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.030
I can't stand it anymore.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:42.860
How did you know the PIN for my card?

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:45.280
It's your ex's birthday, isn't it?

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.160
Get out of here right now!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:51.370
Or I'll call the police!

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.540
Are you serious?

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:58.130
You bastard! Just get out!

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.840
Okay, I'll go.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:09.140
This is a rental.

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.230
H-he is insane!

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.900
<i>There are two treadmills in the gym.</i>

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:25.950
<i>The speed automatically goes up,</i>
<i>and can reach a maximum of 25 km/h.</i>

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:34.710
<i>Usain Bolt can run 100 meters</i>
<i>at 35 to 37 km/h.</i>

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:40.300
<i>That's an impossibility, but we can run</i>
<i>at up to 25 km/h on this machine.</i>

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.510
Want another game?

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:44.340
<i>That's what I said.</i>

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:49.390
<i>There would be only one remote</i>
<i>for both machines.</i>

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:50.890
<i>That was our setup.</i>

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:54.140
<i>We started running at 13.2 km/h.</i>

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.020
<i>We would quickly speed up</i>,
<i>and then at 25 km/h,</i>

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:02.110
<i>the one who can snatch the remote</i>
<i>and press the emergency stop button first</i>

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:03.400
<i>is the winner.</i>

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:07.360
Are there any gym staff around?

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:08.990
Will you keep watch?

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:12.160
It's about my personal training client.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.660
I haven't seen him for two weeks!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.000
What can I do?

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.580
I can't contact him at all either.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:22.050
Are you okay
with the same rules as before?

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:25.420
Of course, if you touch the remote
before we reach 25 km/h, you lose.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.550
Hey, what's with the look?

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:31.140
Hold on, you're dead serious, aren't you?

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:34.770
You don't forget easily, do you?

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.280
<i>Okay with the same rules as before?</i>

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:52.910
You're doing acting
and modeling, aren't you?

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:55.370
How's the work going?

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:59.000
Mr. Kishibe,
you'd better concentrate on running.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:01.920
I've accepted your challenge.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.250
So it's already started.

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:05.970
I won't screw up like last time.

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.510
I'll wipe the floor with you.

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:10.970
Kishibe Rohan!

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:15.310
Whoa!

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:23.520
Seventeen point two km/h.

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:32.030
Your body, it's changed, hasn't it?

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:36.250
Your name is Hashimoto Yoma, right?
You're 21, aren't you?

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:40.210
Wow, look at your side muscles.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.960
How did you get like that?

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:45.340
Serratus anterior muscles?
That's not just any old six-pack.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:50.970
The muscle definition is incredible.
I've never seen anything like that before.

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:53.050
Why don't you just shut up and run?

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:54.930
Now I've passed 18 km/h.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:00.980
<i>What's that?</i>

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.650
<i>The shape of his muscles,</i>

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:04.820
<i>what does this mean!?</i>

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.280
Nineteen km/h.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:12.320
Mr. Kishibe, the last time you quickly
tapped the table with your fingers

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:15.530
and made the situation
advantageous for yourself…

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:20.290
so that the remote would fall
into your hand.

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:24.250
It was a borderline case,
and you can't call that a victory.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:26.380
You can't have ambiguity
in a competition.

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.840
This time you won't get away with it!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.760
Wait a minute, this is just a game.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:35.600
Yes, what we're doing is just a game.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:39.560
Just playing around, but it has
to be fair to decide the winner.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:44.690
Especially for a rematch.
We've gotta decide fairly and squarely.

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:46.770
A rematch has to be done right!

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:49.650
It's just that
you couldn't grab the remote.

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.900
Are you calling me a cheat?

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:54.820
I'm just saying,
our game's gotta be fair.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:55.740
<i>What?!</i>

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.750
<i>What the hell is he doing?!</i>

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:06.750
<i>Backwards?</i>
<i>He's running backwards on the belt?!</i>

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:09.250
<i>At 20 km/h! Running backwards!</i>

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:13.720
<i>Wow, he's in such incredible shape!</i>
<i>But what's he playing at?</i>

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:16.430
<i>Why is he running backwards?!</i>

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:19.770
Hey! What on earth are you<i>…</i>

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:31.900
Twenty point two km/h… now 20.4!

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:38.490
What?! You…

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:41.040
Competition is everywhere, always.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:43.120
So we need fairness.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:46.710
You don't get better without fairness.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:51.550
Now it's fair.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:55.800
Obviously, whoever gets that remote
first is gonna win the perfect victory!

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:59.720
From now on it's gonna be tough,
Mr. Kishibe!

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.640
Who the hell are you?!

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.430
Now it's 21.4 km/h.

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:11.440
Can't press the button yet.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:15.570
Can't press the "stop" button
until we get to 25 km/h!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:18.410
Which of us is gonna get it first?

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:21.040
I left you two fingers
to press the button.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:22.410
That is fairness.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:25.620
So afterwards, no one will hold a grudge.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:30.090
The whole point of a rematch is
to come up with a clear winner. Yeah?

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.050
What…?

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:35.840
Heaven's Door!

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.300
What the hell!

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:39.510
DONE

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:40.930
HAYAMURA MIKA: KILLED

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:42.180
DELIVERYMAN: KILLED

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:43.930
GYM CLIENT: KILLED

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:47.640
<i>He… this Hashimoto Yoma is…</i>

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:51.320
Stop it!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.780
Now it's 23 km/h.

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:56.280
Don't fall over just yet, Mr. Kishibe!

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.660
Twenty-three point three km/h.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:02.200
Twenty-three point seven km/h!

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:03.830
Twenty-four km/h!

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:08.250
Damn it! I'm gonna lose!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.710
Oh, crap! Holy crap!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:15.710
I must get that remote, or I'm finished!

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:42.950
I won!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.160
I won!

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:49.460
I desperately tried to snatch it,

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:53.040
but your movements were
too quick and beautiful.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:55.880
The victory is definitely yours.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:58.760
But sorry, I've got Heaven's Door.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:03.100
It's my special ability to turn someone
into a book and write in it.

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.430
In a split second,
I've just written in you.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:09.560
But where winning's concerned,
you've won. I admit it.

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:10.890
Isn't that enough?

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:13.440
I WILL POINT AT ROHAN'S MACHINE
AND PRESS "STOP."

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.940
<i>You</i> pressed that button.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:25.950
Rohan…

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:43.260
<i>I'm not going to look down</i>
<i>out of this broken window.</i>

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:48.600
<i>Obviously, Yoma is not at the bottom</i>
<i>of the building anymore.</i>

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:52.520
<i>Or he could be clinging</i>
<i>to the wall somewhere.</i>

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:56.980
<i>I've gotta leave this place right now.</i>

00:19:58.530 --> 00:19:59.690
<i>I must get out of here.</i>

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:06.780
<i>I crossed the red line,</i>
<i>though I didn't know it.</i>

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:10.080
<i>If I look down out of this window now,</i>

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:13.870
<i>if I stick my head out,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking down on him,</i>

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:16.500
<i>he will probably kill me.</i>

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:22.050
<i>The muscles on his back</i>
<i>looked just like the shape of wings.</i>

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:24.470
<i>They were above his ankles too.</i>

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:29.850
<i>And I saw them behind his ears,</i>
<i>when the wind parted his hair.</i>

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:32.600
<i>Those were symbols. I'm sure of it.</i>

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:36.060
<i>They showed that he was an avatar.</i>

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:40.860
<i>He was possessed by the god of muscle.</i>

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:43.070
<i>This god has many names…</i>

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:45.610
<i>In Greek mythology, he is called Hermes.</i>

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:50.040
<i>Hashimoto Yoma has turned into</i>
<i>an avatar of Hermes.</i>

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:53.210
<i>I shouldn't have gone anywhere near him.</i>

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:56.420
<i>I risked my life</i>
<i>trying to get that remote.</i>

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.130
<i>It's the truth.</i>

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:02.920
<i>But that doesn't mean that he accepted it.</i>

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:06.760
<i>I hope I haven't provoked his wrath.</i>

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.890
<i>The only thing I can do is run away.</i>

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:56.330
Subtitle translation by Songju Chong
